+## Implementation Plan
+Written before coding, after reading AGENTS.md, CHANGE_REQUEST.md, REQUIREMENTS.md (FR-07), SPEC.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, TASKS.md, `backend/app.js`, `backend/services/movieService.js` and both test files:
